      "content": "To alleviate dizziness and sensitivity, try taking slow, deep breaths to calm your nervous system. Drink a glass of water to ensure you're hydrated, as dehydration can exacerbate lightheadedness. You can also try listening to soothing music or colors, as a visual reminder, to help reduce sensitivity to phone screen brightness. Additionally, try taking breaks to stretch and rest your eyes every hour to give your brain and visual system a break.",
