      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried some water but the dizziness is still pretty bad and it feels like everything is spinning a bit when i move my head. would taking some pretty strong ginger shots or maybe some melatonin help settle my head down so i can just power through the rest of the day? i really cant afford to take time off right now.",
